{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg3Pi8R3uxtjhFSSFxcRa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017faYfLNckFATdFRyd5RHJY","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport glob\np=glob.glob('docs/adr/ADR-005-*.md')[0]\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.rstrip('\\n')+\"\"\"\n\n## Note (2026-10-14)\n\n[ADR-009](./ADR-009-server-render-support-through-render-link.md)\namends this ADR. The host-tag builder, prop serializers and attribute\nescaping no longer live in core. They are in the server render support\nmodule (`microtags/render-support`), which the templaters load and\nwhich core reaches only through a component's `render` static. A\nbrowser bundle contains hydration code only when every render link is\nstripped and the browser templater is not imported. A kept render link\nor the browser templater brings the support module along. Code that\ncalls `render` directly, for example from Hono, imports\n`microtags/render-support` once. The \"core budget stays at 3.5 kB\"\nabove is replaced by the budget recorded in ADR-009 (3.95 kB).\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n\np='docs/adr/ADR-007-client-templater.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"pay nothing; the core entry grows only by the prop accessors.\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"pay nothing; the core entry grows only by the prop accessors.\n(Corrected 2026-10-14: core also grew by the host-tag builder, prop\nserializers and attribute escaping, which every `define()` pulled in.\nADR-009 moves them to the server render support module.)\"\"\"\nassert old in s\ns=s.replace(old,new,1)\ns=s.rstrip('\\n')+\"\"\"\n\n2026-10-14: per ADR-009, the browser templater registers the server\nrender support module when it creates a host, so a kept component's\n`render` static works with no separate import. Carrying that module,\nthe browser templater measures 5.18 kB, and its size limit is 5.2 kB.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n\np='docs/adr/ADR-009-server-render-support-through-render-link.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.rstrip('\\n')\ns=s[:s.rindex('[adr-005]:')].rstrip('\\n')+\"\"\"\n\n## Note (2026-10-14): implementation\n\nTicket 13 landed the decision. The support module is\n`src/render-support.ts`, exported as `microtags/render-support`. The\nserver templater imports it. The browser templater imports it and\ncalls its `register` before it creates a host, so registration\nsurvives anything that cleared the symbol. With the error message\nshortened to name only the subpath, core measures 3.93 kB brotli, and\nits size limit is 3.95 kB. The server templater measures 1.93 kB and\nthe browser templater 5.18 kB (limit raised to 5.2 kB, noted in\nADR-007). The size limits were already higher than the prototype's\nbaseline because other tickets of the same spec landed first.\n\n[adr-005]: ./ADR-005-single-file-components-with-build-time-render-stripping.md\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ntail -5 docs/adr/ADR-009-*.md; grep -n \"ADR-009\\|ADR-005\" docs/adr/INDEX.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":595,"cache_read_input_tokens":104449,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":595},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"10b72dcd-fe8f-4051-b896-6c085ba039d7","uuid":"4a4f20a0-2d10-4f25-82f6-5629bd3401e0","timestamp":"2026-10-15T04:29:02.317Z","request_id":"req_011Cg3Pi86gtXHX38DZTebNK","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_017faYfLNckFATdFRyd5RHJY":{"command":"cd /Users/nick/code/microtags.hydration-dx-fixes-13-server-render-support-module && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport glob\np=glob.glob('docs/adr/ADR-005-*.md')[0]\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.rstrip('\\n')+\"\"\"\n\n## Note (2026-10-14)\n\n[ADR-009](./ADR-009-server-render-support-through-render-link.md)\namends this ADR. The host-tag builder, prop serializers and attribute\nescaping no longer live in core. They are in the server render support\nmodule (`microtags/render-support`), which the templaters load and\nwhich core reaches only through a component's `render` static. A\nbrowser bundle contains hydration code only when every render link is\nstripped and the browser templater is not imported. A kept render link\nor the browser templater brings the support module along. Code that\ncalls `render` directly, for example from Hono, imports\n`microtags/render-support` once. The \"core budget stays at 3.5 kB\"\nabove is replaced by the budget recorded in ADR-009 (3.95 kB).\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n\np='docs/adr/ADR-007-client-templater.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"pay nothing; the core entry grows only by the prop accessors.\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"pay nothing; the core entry grows only by the prop accessors.\n(Corrected 2026-10-14: core also grew by the host-tag builder, prop\nserializers and attribute escaping, which every `define()` pulled in.\nADR-009 moves them to the server render support module.)\"\"\"\nassert old in s\ns=s.replace(old,new,1)\ns=s.rstrip('\\n')+\"\"\"\n\n2026-10-14: per ADR-009, the browser templater registers the server\nrender support module when it creates a host, so a kept component's\n`render` static works with no separate import. Carrying that module,\nthe browser templater measures 5.18 kB, and its size limit is 5.2 kB.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n\np='docs/adr/ADR-009-server-render-support-through-render-link.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.rstrip('\\n')\ns=s[:s.rindex('[adr-005]:')].rstrip('\\n')+\"\"\"\n\n## Note (2026-10-14): implementation\n\nTicket 13 landed the decision. The support module is\n`src/render-support.ts`, exported as `microtags/render-support`. The\nserver templater imports it. The browser templater imports it and\ncalls its `register` before it creates a host, so registration\nsurvives anything that cleared the symbol. With the error message\nshortened to name only the subpath, core measures 3.93 kB brotli, and\nits size limit is 3.95 kB. The server templater measures 1.93 kB and\nthe browser templater 5.18 kB (limit raised to 5.2 kB, noted in\nADR-007). The size limits were already higher than the prototype's\nbaseline because other tickets of the same spec landed first.\n\n[adr-005]: ./ADR-005-single-file-components-with-build-time-render-stripping.md\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ntail -5 docs/adr/ADR-009-*.md; grep -n \"ADR-009\\|ADR-005\" docs/adr/INDEX.md"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_017faYfLNckFATdFRyd5RHJY":{"cwd":"/Users/nick/code/microtags.hydration-dx-fixes-13-server-render-support-module"}}}
